Package: amneziawg-go
Version: @VERSION@
Source: https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amneziawg-go
License: MIT
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: r00t <r00tx@mail.ru>
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: kmod-tun, libc
Description: Userspace AmneziaWG VPN daemon (Go implementation).
 AmneziaWG is a fork of WireGuard with obfuscation against deep-packet
 inspection. This package ships the userspace daemon only; use with
 amneziawg-tools for configuration and amneziawg-merlin-addon for WebUI
 integration on Asuswrt-Merlin routers.
